---
// Merch shop page — products are sold on amazon.de, linked by ASIN (src/data/merch.ts).
import PageShell from '../../../layouts/PageShell.astro';
import StoryArticle from '../../../components/StoryArticle.astro';
import MerchGallery from '../../../components/MerchGallery.astro';

const title = 'Merch & Support — KI einfach verstehen';
const description = 'T-shirts, hoodies, tumblers with AI slogans – available on Amazon. Every purchase supports the freely accessible learning project "KI einfach verstehen".';
---

<PageShell lang="en" title={title} description={description} otherLangHref="/de/merch/" themenHref="/en/#themenbereiche">
	<StoryArticle lang="en" eyebrow="Support the project" title="Merch">
		<p><strong>Wear AI with a sense of humor – and keep "KI einfach verstehen" running.</strong></p>
		<p>
			Every explanation on this site is free to read, with no paywall and no sign-up. To keep it that way, the project
			needs a tailwind: <strong>a share of every merch purchase goes straight back into the project</strong> – into
			research, new building blocks, graphics and technology.
		</p>
		<p>
			And you get something worth showing off: slogans anyone who has worked with AI will recognize, and that describe
			a Monday morning with uncanny precision.{' '}
			<strong>"Context limit reached." "Brain unavailable. Try again later." "Thinking quota exceeded."</strong>
		</p>
		<p>
			In short: you wear an insider joke, and freely available AI knowledge gets your support. A deal with zero
			hallucination.
		</p>
		<section class="story-section">
			<h2>All products</h2>
			<MerchGallery lang="en" />
		</section>
	</StoryArticle>
</PageShell>
